(5, 1, 'Best Car in Bangladesh: Top Models for Value and Comfort', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d259d2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d259d2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Buying\r\n a functional and valuable car in Bangladesh is important as the price \r\nof cars in Bangladesh is relatively higher than in many other Asian \r\ncountries. You want to choose the best car in Bangladesh&nbsp;based on your \r\nbudget, primary use purpose, fuel efficiency, lifestyle, safety \r\nfeatures, etc. Plus, you want to select a car that can withstand strong \r\nimpacts and cause minimal accidental damage. In this article, we will \r\nhelp you choose a decent vehicle in different categories.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82dc1f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82dc1f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Budget Car In Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92a5817 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92a5817\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Petrolheads who prefer significant cost savings will look for <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/lowest-price-cars-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>budget-friendly cars</strong> </a>without compromising quality and performance. One of the primary reasons to <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>buy affordable vehicles</strong></a>\r\n is that they are less expensive to maintain and repair. Plus, you will \r\nsave money on license and registration fees as well as cheaper \r\ninsurance. &nbsp;Also, car enthusiasts will have to worry less about the \r\ndepreciation value of the car.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9424ee4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9424ee4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"666\" height=\"375\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022-toyota-aqua-brass_gold.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5615\" alt=\"2022 toyota aqua brass price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49b2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f49b2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Aqua</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2225373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2225373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you want to enjoy smooth riding with easy maneuverability, <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-aqua-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Aqua is a perfect choice</strong></a>.\r\n This mini sedan has a decent initial torque to revive hard the engine. \r\nBesides, it is one of the most fuel-efficient vehicles. Its average fuel\r\n economy is around 22-25 km per liter. This hybrid electric subcompact \r\ncar is equipped with a smooth engine and linear acceleration to enjoy \r\npeppy driving. &nbsp;Commuters and small families love this car due to its \r\naffordable price tag. The cost of a Toyota Aqua can be anywhere between \r\n12-22.5 lakhs depending on the variant, model, year, etc.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2016</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>12-14 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>13-15 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>15.5-17.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-aqua-s-hybrid-2019/\"><strong>Toyota Aqua 2019</strong></a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>17.5 -19.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>19 -21 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5 -22.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5 -22.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0885377 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0885377\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"595\" height=\"349\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Toyota_Axio_hybrid_Super_White.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5659\" alt=\"Toyota_Axio_hybrid_Super_White\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a61b2d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a61b2d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Axio</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b496599 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b496599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you are looking for an easy-handling vehicle at a reasonable price, you can’t go wrong with a <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-axio-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Axio</strong></a>.\r\n This small-sized passenger car is perfect for a busy city like Dhaka as\r\n it can effortlessly cut through spaces. It is a perfect choice for \r\nsingles and small families. Budget-oriented people whose choices are \r\ntight will surely love this best car in Bangladesh under 20 lakhs. The \r\nprice of Toyota Axio ranges from 18 to 31 lakhs. &nbsp;The vehicle has also a\r\n high resale value with minimal loss. Plus, it has a low refinement \r\nlevel including transmission noise, shaking, and vibration.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>18-23 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-axio-x-non-hybrid-2018-silver/\">Toyota Axio 2018</a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5-25 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-axio-x-black-2019/\">Toyota Axio 2019</a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>23.5 -27.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>24.5 -27.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>25.5 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>25.5 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf323f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bf323f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Mileage Car In Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c511ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c511ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>The\r\n primary benefits of high mileage vehicles are consistence performance \r\nin the long run and longer lifespans. Moreover, fuel-efficient cars \r\ncause less greenhouse gases and decrease smog and pollution \r\nsignificantly. &nbsp;It will also lead to minimal damage to the moving parts \r\nof the vehicle. Apart from saving costs, you are also causing minimal \r\nharm to the environment.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93af0a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"93af0a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Corolla</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76eb0f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"76eb0f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/0208422A30240822W00111.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-17067\" alt=\"Pearl White Toyota Corolla Cross Z 2021 Leather Hybrid\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d07b24d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d07b24d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>When it comes to fuel efficiency, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-corolla-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Corolla is a top choice</strong></a>.\r\n Its engine runs on the Atkinson cycle. This increases the expansion \r\nratio notably more than the compression ratio. The maximum mileage of \r\nthe <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-corolla-hybrid-wxb-2019/\"><strong>Toyota Corolla Hybrid</strong></a>\r\n is up to 50 mpg combined. Car enthusiasts love this vehicle due to its \r\nsafety features, connectivity, cargo space, and smooth ride comfort. \r\nMoreover, this dependable vehicle has low maintenance issues. Hence, you\r\n won’t have to worry about major problems and frequent repairs. \r\n&nbsp;According to IIHS, it has also excellent safe driving capability.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>28 -30 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>31 -35 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>36 -39 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>37 -40 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c38eb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6c38eb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/TOYOTA-ALLION-A-15-G-2019-4.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15667\" alt=\"Black Toyota Allion A15 G 2019\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17ebbe2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"17ebbe2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Allion</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-577bbba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"577bbba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you want to replace your regular sporty vehicles for better fuel consumption purposes, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/allion-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Allion appears perfect</strong></a>.\r\n The average fuel consumption of this best car in Bangladesh under 20 \r\nlakhs&nbsp;is around 13-14 kmpl. But it may slightly vary depending on the \r\nmodel, fuel type, driving style, and transmission. Plus, this reliable \r\nand dependable compact sedan is a good choice for economy mode driving.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2016</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>24 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>26 -31 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>29 -33 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>30 -34 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>31.5 -36 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>33.5 -37.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94f22ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"94f22ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Selling Car in Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0f881a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0f881a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Some\r\n cars are sold in higher units globally compared to others. These \r\nvehicles become highly popular for several reasons, such as build \r\nquality, durability, ease of repair, availability of parts, ease of \r\ndrive, performance, etc. &nbsp;Besides, these vehicles have the best warranty\r\n programs and excellent resale value. In Bangladesh, there are some \r\nhighest-selling vehicles that contribute to a decent car market.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42e98ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"42e98ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/TOYOTA-NOAH-G-2022-WHITE-1.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-13104\" alt=\"Toyota Noah g 2022 pearl Cars for Sale\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dc1809 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2dc1809\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Noah</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e77507d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e77507d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/noah-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Noah</strong></a>\r\n is one of the highest-selling cars in Bangladesh. Car lovers prefer \r\nthis vehicle due to its hybrid technology, budget-friendly price, and \r\neasy-to-get spare parts. This ultimate people mover has earned a decent \r\nreputation for long-term dependability. You can expect this vehicle to \r\nlast about 10 – 15 years and around 150,000 – 200,000 miles easily. Car \r\nenthusiasts can use this multi-purpose car for large families and \r\nbusiness purposes. It accommodates 7-8 passengers easily. The car has \r\nalso an excellent fuel-efficient system, consuming only 20 to 25 \r\nkilometers per liter of petrol.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>23.5 -29.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>27.5 -33 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>28.5 -35 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>38.5 -39 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>42 -44 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>49 -52 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e786e1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e786e1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/TOYOTA-LAND-CRUISER-PRADO-TX-L-PACKAGE-70TH-ANNIVERSARY-LIMITED-1.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15701\" alt=\"Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2021 70th Anniversary\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d7d83c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d7d83c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Land Cruiser Prado</h3></div></div><p>When it comes to off-road capable SUVs, Toyota Land Cruiser Prado is one of the best choices. This <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/prado-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>top-selling vehicle</strong></a>\r\n offers excellent handling and stability even on the toughest terrain. \r\nCar enthusiasts who are looking for an extremely durable SUV will surely\r\n love this vehicle. It can easily provide 25 years of service as the \r\nunit is equipped with expensive and durable components. &nbsp;Its average \r\nfuel consumption is 13.50 kmpl for highway driving and 10.50 kmpl for \r\ncity driving. Besides, this Full-size SUV has a large cargo space to \r\ntake more people and can carry more luggage.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"360\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1 -1.17 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.20 -1.30 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.30 -1.40 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.35 -1.45 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.45 -1.75 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.52 -1.85 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.54 -1.90 </p></td></tr></tbody></table>', 'best-car-in-bangladesh_1734871249.jpg', 1, '2024-12-15 18:52:50', '2024-12-22 18:40:49'),
(6, 3, 'Jeep Car Price in Bangladesh – Affordable & Premium', '<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b81656f\" data-id=\"b81656f\" data-element_type=\"column\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d259d2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d259d2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Jeep\r\n cars have a classic and unique design. Driving them on the rockiest \r\noff-road terrains is easygoing, unlike regular vehicles. These tough and\r\n durable cars are easy to repair, too. Plus, they have a high ground \r\nclearance to pass over obstacles such as rocks or uneven ground \r\neffortlessly. These dependable vehicles are perfect for driving on \r\nsmooth and off-roads in Bangladesh. But how much does a jeep car price \r\nin Bangladesh? We will review various Jeep vehicles in different price \r\ncategories. Let’s dive in without further ado!</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82dc1f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82dc1f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cheapest Jeep Cars in Bangladesh – Best Budget Models</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92a5817 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92a5817\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>When it comes to a <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/lowest-price-cars-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>low car price in Bangladesh</strong></a>, the Army Jeep, Mahindra Jeep, Jeep Wrangler, Suzuki Jeep, etc. are the top choices.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9424ee4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9424ee4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"670\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Suzuki-Jimny-Sierra.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16725\" alt=\"suzuki jimny price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49b2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f49b2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Suzuki Jimny Sierra</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2225373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2225373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Wondering\r\n how much a Suzuki jeep price in Bangladesh? The Suzuki Jimny Sierra is \r\nan affordable and easy-to-drive vehicle. This great little versatile car\r\n has impressive off-road capabilities. With this true off-roader, you \r\nwon’t have a hard time to pass over tricky road terrains. The beginning \r\nprice of this vehicle is as low as 32 Lakh BDT. It will vary depending \r\non the model, variants, and other factors.</p><table width=\"552\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"348\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Suzuki Jimny XL package 2019</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>32 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Suzuki Jimny Sierra JL Package 2019</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>36.50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Suzuki Jimny Sierra JL Package 2020</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>42 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0885377 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0885377\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"600\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/mahindra-thar-price-in-bangladesh.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16729\" alt=\"mahindra thar price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a61b2d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a61b2d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> 02. Mahindra Thar</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b496599 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b496599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Are\r\n you a fan of Mahindra Jeep cars? Mahindra Thar is well-known for its \r\nold-school, rugged aesthetics. Whether mud, rocks, or steep hills, this \r\nspecial vehicle will leave you stunned through its performance. A used \r\nMahindra jeep <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>car price in Bangladesh</strong></a> can be as low as 9.80 Lakh BDT.</p><table width=\"552\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"348\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Mahindra Thar 2010 (Manual Transmission)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>9.80 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Mahindra Thar 2010 (Automatic Transmission)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>10 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"348\"><p>Mahindra Thar 2016 (Automatic Transmission)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>13.75 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-232d21e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"232d21e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"612\" height=\"365\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/jeep-wrangler-price-in-bangladesh.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16730\" alt=\"jeep wrangler price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf323f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bf323f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">03. Jeep Wrangler</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c511ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c511ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Jeep\r\n Wranglers are well-known for their ever-evolving convenience and \r\ncomfort. This rugged and dependable vehicle can tackle harsh weather \r\nconditions so smoothly. You can customize this formidable off-road beast\r\n based on your preference. A wrangler jeep price in Bangladesh can be as\r\n low as 37 Lakh BDT. But the latest versions can cost more than 1 crore.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Jeep Wrangler Sport S 2024</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>37.31 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Jeep Wrangler Rubicon X 2024</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>53.11 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Jeep Wrangler Sahara 2024</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>55.95 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76eb0f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"76eb0f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"700\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Brand-New-Nissan-X-Trail-Price-4.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8393\" alt=\"Brand New Nissan X Trail Price 4\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93af0a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"93af0a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">04. Nissan X Trail Jeep</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d07b24d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d07b24d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Nissan\r\n X Trail is a flagship SUV, but it is a tough competitor to Jeep cars \r\nand has many facilities similar to those of Jeep vehicles. Whether steep\r\n uphill slopes, uneven dirt roads, or sands, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/nissan-x-trail-price-in-bangladesh/\"><b>Nissan X Trail</b></a>\r\n can provide plenty of competent performance. This jeep car has \r\napproximately 200mm clearance to traverse uneven and rough terrains. You\r\n won’t have to worry about undercarriage damage. The starting <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/nissan-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Nissan price in Bangladesh</strong></a> is around 48 Lakh BDT.&nbsp;</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail Regular</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail S 4WD (7 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>51 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail SV 4WD (7 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail SL 4WD (7 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>55 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail S 2WD (7 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail S 2WD (5 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>48 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Nissan X Trail S 4WD (5 Seater)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c38eb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6c38eb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"800\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/2022-Honda-CR-V-Sonic-Gray-Pearl.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-7853\" alt=\"2022 Honda CR-V Sonic Gray Pearl\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17ebbe2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"17ebbe2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">05. Honda CR-V</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-577bbba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"577bbba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/honda-cr-v-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Honda CR-V</strong></a>\r\n is another tough competitor of the Jeep Cherokee and Jeep Wrangler. \r\nDriving this beast on mild off-roads is completely okay as long as \r\neither the front or rear wheels are on tractionable ground. Besides, \r\ntreacherous terrains like snow or mud will cause minimal damage to this \r\nvehicle. Drivers can use the AWD option to use the car for off-pavement \r\nexcursions on dirt roads or slippery surfaces. You can drive the vehicle\r\n 100 miles straight without any breaks.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2018)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>46 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2018)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>49 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>49 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>52 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>51.5 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>55 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>56 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>60 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>62 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>66 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>63 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Honda CR V EX Masterpiece (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>70 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94f22ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"94f22ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mid-range Jeep Cars in Bangladesh – Value-Packed Options</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0f881a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0f881a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Mid-range\r\n Jeep vehicles perfectly combine features, performance, and values. They\r\n are ideal for adventure seekers, camping, hiking, daily commutes, and \r\nother outdoor activities.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42e98ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"42e98ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Mitsubishi-Outlander-PHEV-2020-Pearl-White-Hybrid-3.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-13215\" alt=\"mitsubishi outlander price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dc1809 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2dc1809\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Mitsubishi Outlander</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e77507d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e77507d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Many car enthusiasts often compare the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/mitsubishi-outlander-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Mitsubishi Outlander</strong></a>\r\n with Jeep Wrangler and Jeep Cherokee. This powerful vehicle is equipped\r\n with an S-AWC system to execute three types of control for consistent \r\nand seamless vehicle behaviour. Hence, driving on muddy and moderately \r\nuneven ground will be easygoing. You will get the best possible traction\r\n in almost every condition. However, you should not expect the same \r\nlevel of performance on steep hills with loose terrain like a powerful \r\nJeep car.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Price Range</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2018)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>48-54 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>60 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>65 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>69 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>90 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>92 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e786e1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e786e1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"700\" height=\"325\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Toyota-Harrier-Exterior-In-Bangladesh-3.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8539\" alt=\"Toyota Harrier Exterior In Bangladesh 3\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d7d83c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d7d83c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Harrier</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f088b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f088b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-harrier-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Harrier</strong> </a>is\r\n often compared with Jeep Compass and Jeep Wrangler Unlimited as it has a\r\n limited off-road capability. You can take this vehicle on light rural \r\noff-roading. It is equipped with an intelligent Terrain Response System \r\nwhere drivers can select some special driving modes, such as rough, wet,\r\n and normal. However, don’t expect it to perform like a full-fledged \r\noff-road vehicle.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Price Range</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Harrier (2018)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>61-68 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Harrier (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>64-71 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Harrier (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>69-85 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Harrier (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>82-91 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Harrier (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>89-96 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3fef73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b3fef73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"641\" height=\"481\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Toyota-Rav-4-Prime-G-Picture-3-cartheoryBD.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-12766\" alt=\"Toyota Rav 4 Prime G Picture-3-cartheoryBD\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d9a387 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d9a387\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">03. Jeep Toyota RAV 4</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-055973c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"055973c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Whether it is the Jeep Compass, Jeep Cherokee, or Jeep Wrangler, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-rav-4-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota RAV 4</strong></a>\r\n can give tough competition to regular Jeep vehicles. This rugged car \r\ncomes with various off-road modes, such as mud &amp; sand, rock &amp; \r\ndirt, and snow. Even if you stop halfway on these off-roads, you can \r\nstart again and reach the top. This Toyota Jeep price in Bangladesh can \r\nbe anywhere from 50 to 78 Lakh BDT, depending on the model and \r\ncondition.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Average Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 X (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>50 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>54 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 X (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>51.5 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>56 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 X (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>56.5 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>62 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>70 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 Adventure (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>73 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>74 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 Adventure (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>77 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 G (2024)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>76 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Toyota Rav 4 Adventure (2024)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>78 Lakh BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dae481e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dae481e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Expensive Jeep Cars in Bangladesh – Premium Features</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8b841c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8b841c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>High-end\r\n jeep cars have upscale interiors and advanced features. They can give \r\nyou a unique, exhilarating driving experience. These jeep vehicles are \r\nequipped with modern technology and crucial safety features. Their \r\niconic style, rugged construction, and comfort are worth the extra \r\nmoney.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f0e30a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0f0e30a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"580\" height=\"290\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/mercedes-benz-car-price-in-bangladesh.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16737\" alt=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-232583e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"232583e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Mercedes Benz G-Class</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-233d0fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"233d0fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Very\r\n few come close to the Mercedes Benz G-Class when it comes to off-road \r\nexcellence. This powerful beast is equipped with front, middle, and rear\r\n lockers. Its formidable off-road prowess can handle any tough terrain \r\nsmoothly. Whether it is rugged rocky terrain, cross-axle gullies, deep \r\nwater crossings, or ski slopes, this exceptional vehicle is perfect for \r\nalmost all types of off-road exploration. The beginning Mercedes Jeep \r\nprice in Bangladesh</p><table width=\"426\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"258\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"168\"><p><strong>Average Price </strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class 500</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.51 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class 500 Cabriolet</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.51 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class AMG 63</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.60 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class (2023)</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.63 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class AMG 65</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.65 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"258\"><p>Mercedes Benz G-Class AMG (2019)</p></td><td width=\"168\"><p>1.95 Crore BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ed9612 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8ed9612\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/TOYOTA-LAND-CRUISER-PRADO-TX-L-PACKAGE-70TH-ANNIVERSARY-LIMITED-2.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15703\" alt=\"Toyota Prado 2021 70th Anniversary Edition\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8001cf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8001cf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Land Cruiser Prado</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6d6fe8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d6d6fe8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado is a decent and very capable off-roader. That’s why many car geeks love to compare <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/prado-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Land Cruiser Prado</strong></a>\r\n with Jeep Wrangler and Jeep Grand Cherokee. You can drive this vehicle \r\nsafely on off-roads while keeping the rear cross-axle locker engaged. It\r\n will make the brake-traction control effective. However, it is best to \r\nswitch thetyres to knobby tyres when you drive the vehicle on flat \r\ngravel and dirt roads. This alternative to the Wrangler Jeep price in \r\nBangladesh is around 1-1.90 Crore BDT.</p><table width=\"456\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"252\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"204\"><p><strong>Price Range</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2017)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1-1.17 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2018)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.20-1.30 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2019)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.30-1.40 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2020)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.35-1.45 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2021)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.45-1.75 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2022)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.52-1.85 Crore BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"252\"><p>Land Cruiser Prado (2023)</p></td><td width=\"204\"><p>1.54-1.90 Crore BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7997638 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7997638\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Final Words</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10e95bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"10e95bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>A\r\n jeep price in Bangladesh can be as low as 10 Lakh and as high as a few \r\ncrore. The cost of a jeep car will be influenced by various factors, \r\nsuch as the jeep vehicle’s brand, model, variant, quality of the \r\nmaterials, build quality, vehicle condition, mileage, features, etc. We \r\nhave discussed various types of jeeps in different categories to help \r\nour readers choose their preferred one. <br></p></div></div></div></div>', 'Jeep-Car-Price-in-Bangladesh_1734871330.jpg', 1, '2024-12-15 18:54:06', '2024-12-22 18:42:10');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `blog_category_id`, `blog_name`, `blog_description`, `blog_image`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7, 4, 'Range Rover Price in BD: Off-road Beast And Desirable Vehicles', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d259d2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d259d2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Range\r\n Rover cars are well-known for theirelegant and luxurious design, \r\ncomfortable seating, and top-quality materials with wiz-bang tech. If \r\nyou want to get a premium and sophisticated driving experience, these \r\nluxury SUVs are the perfect choice. These quite capable vehicles have \r\nunparalleled off-roading capabilities. Their improved ground clearance \r\nand throttle response made them the best off-road SUVs. Let’s learn the \r\nRange Rover price In BD&nbsp;of different models.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0885377 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0885377\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Range-Rover-Evoque.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18450\" alt=\"Range Rover Evoque\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82dc1f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82dc1f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Range Rover Evoque</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92a5817 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92a5817\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If\r\n you are looking for a small and affordable SUV, Range Rover Evoque \r\nappears perfect. This stylish and luxurious subcompact SUV is anideal \r\nchoice for city roads. It is equipped with All-Terrain Progress Control \r\ntechnology to maintain constant speed, especially for challenging \r\noff-road conditions. Plus, this luxury compact SUV features Terrain \r\nResponse to automatically adjust transmission, suspension, and traction \r\nsettings. Let’s learn about the Range Rover Evoque price in Bangladesh.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"336\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque S (2012)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.03 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic SE(2012)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.05 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic HSE (2012)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.16 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque S (2015)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.08 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic SE(2015)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.20 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic HSE (2015)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.30 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque S (2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.15 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic SE(2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.30 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"336\"><p>Range Rover Evoque Dynamic HSE (2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>1.40 Cr BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Specifications </strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Engine Name</strong>: 2.0-liter turbocharged inline-4</li><li><strong>Engine Capacity</strong>: 1997 cc</li><li><strong>Power</strong>: 201bhp @ 3750rpm</li><li><strong>Torque</strong>: 430Nm @ 1750rpm</li><li><strong>Transmission</strong>: A ZF 9-speed automatic transmission</li><li><strong>Fuel Efficiency</strong>: 31MPG for City &amp; and 26 MPG for highway</li><li><strong>Seat Capacity</strong>: 5</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-996b4d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"996b4d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Range-Rover-Velar.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18449\" alt=\"Range Rover Velar\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49b2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f49b2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Range Rover Velar</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2225373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2225373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Car\r\n enthusiasts who prefer a family-friendly luxurious SUV can’t go wrong \r\nwith Range Rover Velar. This midsize luxury SUV is equipped with plug-in\r\n hybrid engine to reduce fuel consumption and emissions. You will get \r\nenhanced horsepower, torque, and refinement due to the Ingenium petrol \r\nengine. It especially comes in handy for city driving and short \r\ncommutes.Range Rover Velar features Dynamic Stability Control (DSC) to \r\nsecure the car’s stability in critical driving situations. The Range \r\nRover Velar price in Bangladesh is given below:</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"361\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverDynamic Velar HSE (2017)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.15 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range Rover Velar Dynamic HSE Diesel (2017)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.51 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>RangeRoverDynamic Velar HSE (2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.19 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range Rover Velar Dynamic HSE Diesel (2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.59 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>RangeRoverDynamic Velar HSE (2019)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.21 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range Rover Velar Dynamic HSE Diesel (2019)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.65 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>RangeRoverDynamic Velar HSE (2020)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.25 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range Rover Velar Dynamic HSE Diesel (2020)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.69 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>RangeRoverDynamic Velar HSE (2021)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.31 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range Rover Velar Dynamic HSE Diesel (2021)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.75 Cr BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Specifications </strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Engine Name</strong>: 2.0-liter D200Ingenium turbo</li><li><strong>Engine Capacity</strong>: 1997 cc</li><li><strong>Power</strong>: 246.74bhp @ 5500rpm</li><li><strong>Torque</strong>: 365Nm @ 1500-4000rpm</li><li><strong>Transmission</strong>: An8-speed ZF 8HP automatictransmission</li><li><strong>Fuel Efficiency</strong>: 22 MPG for City &amp; and 26 MPG for highway</li><li><strong>Seat Capacity</strong>: 5</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cbbb95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1cbbb95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Range-Rover-L322.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18448\" alt=\"Range Rover L322\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-280be35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"280be35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Range Rover L322</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59cc22b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"59cc22b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If\r\n you prefer to buy a vehicle that can offer a great mix of capability, \r\ncomfort, and luxury, the Range Rover L322 might be your ultimate choice.\r\n The latest version comes with a Ford 4.4 L TDV8 engine. It offers \r\nbetter power and gearbox as well as increased fuel efficiency. Plus, \r\nnewer versions are equipped with an updated Jaguar-derived electrics \r\nsystem to deliver a thrilling driving experience, with instant torque \r\nand smooth acceleration. This system can extend the vehicle’s range by \r\ncapturing kinetic energy. Let’s learn about the Range Rover price in \r\nBangladesh.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"361\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL322 (2009)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.15 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL322 (2010)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.51 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL322 (2011)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.19 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL322 (2012)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.59 Cr BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Specifications </strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Engine Name</strong>: Ford 4.4-liter TDV8 engine</li><li><strong>Engine Capacity</strong>: 4,394cc</li><li><strong>Power</strong>: 301bhp @ 5750rpm</li><li><strong>Torque</strong>: 440Nm @ 4000rpm</li><li><strong>Transmission</strong>: An8-speed ZF 8HP automatictransmission</li><li><strong>Fuel Efficiency</strong>: 13.65 L/100km</li><li><strong>Seat Capacity</strong>: 5 or 7 seats</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e623deb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e623deb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Range-Rover-L405.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18447\" alt=\"Range Rover L405\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b393d10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b393d10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Range Rover L405</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d344f1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4d344f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>This\r\n reliable fourth-generation car has an aluminum monocoque body structure\r\n to provide good crash protection. It can withstand higher tensile and \r\ncompressive forces. Plus, the Range Rover L405 is equipped with \r\ndual-camera dashcamsto identify harsh events and detect crashes while \r\nprotecting and enhancing the driver’s performance. Additionally, it has a\r\n powered anti-roll system to decrease the vehicle body leaning in one \r\ndirection during fast cornering or over-road irregularities. Check out \r\nthe Range Rover <strong><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/car-prices-in-bd/\">car price in Bangladesh</a></strong>.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"361\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL405 (2017)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.15 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL405 (2018)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.51 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL405 (2019)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.19 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL405 (2020)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.59 Cr BDT</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"361\"><p>Range RoverL405 (2021)</p></td><td width=\"132\"><p>4.59 Cr BDT</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Specifications </strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Engine Name</strong>: Ford 4.4-liter SDV8 engine</li><li><strong>Engine Capacity</strong>: 4,367 cc</li><li><strong>Power</strong>: 339bhp @ 3500rpm</li><li><strong>Torque</strong>: 516Nm @ 1750-3000 rpm</li><li><strong>Transmission</strong>: An8-speed ZF 8HP automatictransmission</li><li><strong>Fuel Efficiency</strong>: 34mpg</li><li><strong>Seat Capacity</strong>: 4-5 seats</li></ul></div></div>', 'Range-Rover-price-in-bd-1_1734871104.jpg', 1, '2024-12-15 18:55:24', '2024-12-22 18:39:23'),
(8, 3, 'Top Car Showrooms in Bangladesh 2024', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d259d2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d259d2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Thousands\r\n of car showrooms are in Bangladesh. Most of these vehicles are imported\r\n from Japan, China, and India. When it comes to choosing a well-valued \r\nand practical car, you must get it from a reliable car showroom in \r\nBangladesh. After all, it is a long-term investment. You don’t want your\r\n hard-earned cash to go in vain. After researching the automobile \r\nindustry, our experts have chosen some best car showrooms in BD that can\r\n offer long-term satisfaction with your vehicle and explore various \r\ntypes of brands and models under one roof.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82dc1f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82dc1f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Car House Ltd.</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92a5817 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92a5817\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Car\r\n House Limited started its journey in 1993. Initially, they had a small \r\nshowroom. It could only accommodate 15 vehicles. But later, the company \r\nexpanded its showroom space. Now, the showroom is big enough to fit 40 \r\nvehicles, including the outside space. Car House Ltd. sells brand, \r\nreconditioned, and used cars. They have a good collection of SUVs, MUVs,\r\n Hatchbacks, Wagons, Sedan Cars, Mini Vans, Pickups, Jeeps, etc.</p><table width=\"480\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>10:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>105, Kakrail Road, Dhaka, Bangladesh, 1000</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>01924-500255</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>Carhouseltdbd@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/CarHouseImports/</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"348\"><p>https://www.japanesecartrade.com/carhouse/</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49b2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f49b2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Car Theory BD</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2225373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2225373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you are looking for the best Japanese reconditioned car showroom, Cartheorybd is the best choice. Their Japanese <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/car-prices-in-bd/\"><strong>cars’ prices</strong></a>\r\n are lower than competitors without compromising the quality. They have \r\nbeen in the automobile industry for almost 10 years. This car dealer \r\nsells both new and pre-owned vehicles based on customers’ unique needs. \r\nApart from trading vehicles, they own a service center to provide \r\nmaintenance and repair services. You will stay stress-free as they offer\r\n a comprehensive warranty program. Customers can purchase cars through \r\ndifferent financial options based on their needs. They can deliver your \r\npreferred car anywhere in Bangladesh.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://g.co/kgs/nRcSkwh\"><strong>Car Theory BD</strong></a> provides card payment facilities. Customers can use their credit or debit card to clear the down payment.</li><li>This\r\n car dealer offers bank payment facilities, such as a cashier’s check, \r\ncertified check, bank draft, etc. Customers can also pay through direct \r\ncash.</li><li>They offers EMI facilities to manage your repayment with affordable installments.</li><li>Car\r\n Theory BD sells various brands of cars, such as Toyota, Honda, \r\nMitsubishi, Hyundai, Mazda, etc. They have around 200 hundreds of cars \r\nin their current stock.</li><li>The company has already sold over 5000 cars till now. More than 30,000 customers visit their showroom .</li><li>Car\r\n Theory BD has a well-designed showroom that generates a sense of \r\nexclusivity and branding to enhance customer experience and purchasing \r\ndecisions.</li><li>This <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/\"><strong>car retailer</strong></a> open their showroom daily to cater to the diverse needs and schedules of potential customers.</li><li>Car\r\n Theory BD has an expert customer support team to address customer \r\ninquiries, complaints, and concerns promptly and effectively and resolve\r\n issues related to vehicle purchases, financing, repairs, or \r\nmaintenance.</li></ul><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>09:00 am to 09:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>5th Floor, House# 11, Navana Shefali, Road# 14 , Gulshan 1, Dhaka-1212</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>01312000566</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>cartheorybd@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Instagram</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/car_theory_bd/\">https://www.instagram.com/car_theory_bd/</a></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Facebook</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/cartheorybangladesh\">https://www.facebook.com/cartheorybangladesh</a></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>YouTube</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p><strong>https://www.youtube.com/@cartheorybd</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><blockquote class=\"wp-embedded-content\" data-secret=\"eA99RExjKN\"><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/\">CarTheoryBD | &nbsp;Best Car Importer in Bangladesh</a></blockquote></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a61b2d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a61b2d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">03. Car Selection</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b496599 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b496599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>This\r\n popular automobile importer, wholesaler, and retailer start their \r\njourney in the year 1997. Car Selection is committed to offering \r\nhigh-quality cars at the best price based on the customers’ specific \r\nneeds. They also provide dependable after-sales- services. This leading \r\ncar dealer sells different branded cars, such as Toyota, Honda, Nissan, \r\nMitsubishi, etc. The company has three car showrooms in Bangladesh \r\nincluding Palton, Baridhara, and Gulshan. They are awarded the highest \r\ntaxpayer consecutively for 11 fiscal years from 2013 to 2022.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>10:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>44 Progati Sarani Rd, Dhaka-1212</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>01759115577 | &nbsp;01708410918</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>carselection002@gmail.com | carselection003@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/carselectionbangladesh</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www. carselectionbd.com</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf323f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bf323f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">04. Car Dealer Ltd.</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c511ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c511ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Car\r\n Dealer Ltd. has a luxury car showroom in Bangladesh, that started its \r\njourney in 2018. They have helped more than 500 clients to purchase \r\ntheir dream car till now. Plus, their showroom has a variety of cars \r\nfrom different brands, such as Toyota, Honda, Lexus, BMW, Isuzu, Mazda, \r\nNissan, Mitsubishi, etc. They sell both Japanese and European vehicles. \r\n&nbsp;The company has only one showroom at first. But now, they own three \r\ndisplay centers in Bangladesh. Car Dealer Ltd. also introduced the “Car \r\nDealer Membership Programme” to provide after-sales service and satisfy \r\ntheir customers.</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>10:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>342 NAYANAGAR, Cocacola Rd, Dhaka-1212.</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>01886001771</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>cardealerbd@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/cardealerbd/</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.cardealerbd.com/</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93af0a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"93af0a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">05. Asian Imports Limited</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d07b24d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d07b24d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>When\r\n it comes to exclusive collections of the finest vehicles, Asian Imports\r\n Limited. stands out. &nbsp;The company sells both brand-new and \r\nreconditioned vehicles from different brands, such as Mercedes, Benz, \r\nToyota, Mazda, Honda, etc. They have been vehicle business for more than\r\n 20 years. Customers will get the original mileage and genuine <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/auction-sheet-verification/\"><strong>auction sheet</strong></a>\r\n with the actual auction report to purchase vehicles. If your car breaks\r\n down on the roads, Asian Imports LTD. can provide emergency assistance \r\nto solve your problem over the phone.</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>10:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>I/A, 277, Bir Uttam Mir Shawkat Sarak, Dhaka 1208.</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>01844495142</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>asianimportsmkt@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/asianimportsbd</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\">https://asianimportsltd.com/</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94f22ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"94f22ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">06. Auto Museum Limited</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0f881a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0f881a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Are\r\n you looking for luxurious premium cars? Auto Museum Limited is a top \r\nchoice for this purpose. This car dealer started their vehicle business \r\nin 1991. They sell a wide variety of luxurious cars, such as Toyota, \r\nPorsche, Lexus, Bentley, Nissan, Land Rover, etc. Auto Museum Limited \r\nhas a good collection of sports cars, sedan cars, SUVs, and heavy-body \r\nvehicles. This automobile dealer has a car showroom in Gulshan and \r\nanother one in Baridhara. They offer car loans to purchase cars through \r\nconvenient financing options.</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>10:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>House-16, Road-111, Gulshan-2, Dhaka-1213.</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>01718 388292 |&nbsp; 01711 241180 |&nbsp; 01726 111485</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>info.automuseumltd@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/automuseumltd.official</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.automuseum.com.bd/</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dc1809 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2dc1809\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">07. Maxim Car Centre</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e77507d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e77507d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Maxim\r\n Car Centre is a reliable trade partner of ACT Company LTD, Japan. They \r\nhave been in the vehicle business for over 24 years. The price of their \r\nvehicles is a little higher than others as they cross-check all the \r\nparts after buying from auctions. But there will be no compromise in \r\nquality. &nbsp;The company has two car showrooms in Bangladesh: one car \r\nshowroom in Dhaka and another one in Chittagong. Maxim Car Centre mainly\r\n sells a wide variety of Toyota cars, such as Toyota Fielder, Harrier, \r\nPremio, Allion, Esquire, Prius, Axio, Aqua, Noah, Pick-Up, etc.</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>10:00 am to 07:30 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>223 Bir Uttam Mir Shawkat Sarak, Dhaka-1208.</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>+88-031-2515765</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>maximcardhaka@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/MaximCarDhaka/</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>http://www.maximcarcentre.com/Home</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c805c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0c805c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">08. MG Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f088b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f088b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>MG\r\n Bangladesh is not just a car dealer. They are a British automotive \r\ncompany that has been in the automobile industry since 1924. &nbsp;The \r\ncompany is the official partner of RANCON which sells and distributes \r\ncars throughout all districts in Bangladesh. MG Bangladesh has five \r\nshowrooms in Bangladesh, including Dhaka, Chittagong, Khulna, and \r\nBogura. They currently sell three models of MG cars in Bangladesh, \r\nincluding MG5, MG ZST, and MG HS. These vehicles have good value, \r\nstyling, and fuel efficiency.</p><table width=\"546\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Office Hours</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>09:00 am to 08:00 pm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Address</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>215 Bir Uttam Mir Shawkat Sarak, Dhaka-1208</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Phone</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>+880 9617-454545</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Email</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>mgbangladeshtt@gmail.com</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Social Media Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><p>https://www.facebook.com/mgbangladesh/about</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"132\"><p><strong>Website Link</strong></p></td><td width=\"414\"><blockquote class=\"wp-embedded-content\" data-secret=\"6FdvxvsupK\"><a href=\"https://mgmotor.com.bd/\">Home</a></blockquote></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d9a387 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d9a387\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Factors Affect The Growth of Car Showrooms In Bangladesh?</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-055973c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"055973c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>The number of car showrooms in Bangladesh is increasing day by day. Many factors contribute to this amazing growth.</p><h3><strong>Economic Growth</strong>:</h3><p>The\r\n average annual GDP growth rate of Bangladesh is 5.87%. Due to the \r\ngradual rise in income level, overall private vehicle ownerships \r\nincrease. More number of people are buying personal cars.</p><h3><strong>Urbanization</strong>:</h3><p>Urbanized\r\n areas have more people due to high job prospects. &nbsp;Congestion, traffic \r\njams, and pollution are more common in cities. Hence, people prefer to \r\nown and use private vehicles to save their time.</p><h3><strong>Changing Lifestyles</strong>:</h3><p>Owning\r\n a car in a developing country like Bangladesh is considered the \r\nultimate status symbol. Your financial standing and personal style are \r\noften reflected in the car you own.</p><p><strong>Wide Variety of Options</strong>:</p><p>Now,\r\n people have options to choose cars from various brands. Many \r\ninternational brands are even keen to invest in Bangladesh. This leads \r\nto a rise in the number of car showrooms in Bangladesh.</p><h3><strong>Financing Options</strong>:</h3><p>Many\r\n car dealer companies sell vehicles through loans. This increases the \r\ndemand for owning personal vehicles. Some car business organizations \r\noffer 5 years or more car loans. You just need to clear a small \r\nproportion of the downpayment.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Technological Advancements</strong>:</h3><p>More\r\n exciting innovations are added to the automobile industry every year.&nbsp; \r\nThe future of cars will be electric, autonomous, and connected through \r\ndigital technology. It will increase the demand for new cars and more \r\nshowrooms will be opened.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dae481e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dae481e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What are The Challenges for Future Car Showrooms?</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8b841c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8b841c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Though the prospects for new car showrooms are flourishing, there are still some challenges.</p><h3><strong>Infrastructure</strong>:</h3><p>Better\r\n transportation infrastructure is a must to increase the demand for \r\nowning personal vehicles. The government should take steps to fund \r\nhighways, roads, and parking lots. Otherwise, it will affect the market \r\ndemand for cars.</p><h3><strong>Environmental Issues</strong>:</h3><p>The\r\n air pollution level of Bangladesh is not up to mark compared to \r\ndeveloped countries. One of the best solutions is using electric \r\nvehicles. This will cause minimal impact on environmental pollution.</p><h3><strong>Regulations and Taxes</strong>:</h3><p>The\r\n import tax of a car is at least 200%. It can be as high as 350% \r\ndepending on the brand and engine capacity. Plus, Bangladesh car import \r\nrules and vehicular-emission standards will directly or indirectly \r\naffect car ownership decisions.</p><h3><strong>After-Sales Service</strong>:</h3><p>It\r\n is necessary to provide warranty and after-sales services to ensure \r\nbetter customer satisfaction. This will build loyal customers and help \r\nbrands to grow their business.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7997638 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7997638\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conclusion</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10e95bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"10e95bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>As\r\n a conscious car enthusiast, you must choose a reliable car showroom in \r\nBangladesh to get a quality vehicle at the best price. We have already \r\nmentioned the 8 best car dealers to choose a reliable personal car based\r\n on your budget. You can buy new or reconditioned vehicles depending on \r\nhow much you want to pay. Car Theory BD is one of the best choices for \r\nbuying affordable Japanese cars at an attractive price. &nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-508b6e1\" data-id=\"508b6e1\" data-element_type=\"column\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2e3d75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-sidebar\" data-id=\"d2e3d75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"sidebar.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><aside id=\"block-6\" class=\"widget widget-default widget_block widget_search\"><form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" action=\"https://cartheorybd.com/\" class=\"wp-block-search__no-button wp-block-search\"><label class=\"wp-block-search__label screen-reader-text\" for=\"wp-block-search__input-1\">Search</label><div class=\"wp-block-search__inside-wrapper \"><input class=\"wp-block-search__input\" id=\"wp-block-search__input-1\" placeholder=\"Search\" value=\"\" type=\"search\" name=\"s\" required=\"\"></div></form></aside><aside id=\"contacts-2\" class=\"widget widget-default widget_contacts\"><div class=\"widget-title\"><h4>Contact</h4></div><ul class=\"stm-list-duty heading-font\"><li class=\"widget_contacts_address\"><div class=\"icon\"><i class=\"stm-icon-pin\"></i></div><div class=\"text\">248/7 Taspia Shopnochura, Dakshinkhan Dhaka-1230</div></li><li class=\"widget_contacts_phone\"><div class=\"icon\"><i class=\"stm-service-icon-sales_phone\"></i></div><div class=\"text\">01312-000566</div></li><li class=\"widget_contacts_hours\"><div class=\"icon\"><i class=\"stm-service-icon-sales_hours\"></i></div><div class=\"text\">9am-9pm</div></li></ul></aside><aside id=\"stm_similar_cars-2\" class=\"widget widget-default stm_similar_cars\"><div class=\"widget-title\"><h4>Latest Cars</h4></div><div class=\"stm-similar-cars-units\"> <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-yaris-cross-z-hybrid-2020-4/\" class=\"stm-similar-car clearfix\"><div class=\"image\"> <img width=\"350\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/YARIS-CROSS-Z-HYBRID-5-350x356.webp\" class=\"img-responsive wp-post-image\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"right-unit\"><div class=\"title\">Toyota Yaris Cross Z 2020 Blue Hybrid</div><div class=\"clearfix\"><div class=\"stm-price heading-font\">৳3 ,300 ,000</div><div class=\"stm-car-similar-meta\"> <i class=\"stm-rental-bag\"></i> <span>Z</span></div></div></div> </a> <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-harrier-z-leather-hybrid-2020/\" class=\"stm-similar-car clearfix\"><div class=\"image\"> <img width=\"350\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/HARRIER-Z-LEATHER-2020-1-350x356.webp\" class=\"img-responsive wp-post-image\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"right-unit\"><div class=\"title\">Toyota Harrier Z Leather 2020 Pearl White Hybrid</div><div class=\"clearfix\"><div class=\"stm-price heading-font\">৳6 ,700 ,000</div><div class=\"stm-car-similar-meta\"> <i class=\"stm-rental-bag\"></i> <span>Z Leather</span></div></div></div> </a> <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-aqua-crossover-hybrid-2020/\" class=\"stm-similar-car clearfix\"><div class=\"image\"> <img width=\"350\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Aqua-Crossover-2020-1-350x356.webp\" class=\"img-responsive wp-post-image\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"right-unit\"><div class=\"title\">Toyota Aqua Crossover 2020 Silver Hybrid</div><div class=\"clearfix\"><div class=\"stm-price heading-font\">৳1 ,950 ,000</div><div class=\"stm-car-similar-meta\"> <i class=\"stm-rental-bag\"></i> <span>Crossover</span></div></div></div> </a></div></aside><aside id=\"block-8\" class=\"widget widget-default widget_block widget_categories\"><div class=\"wp-block-categories-dropdown wp-block-categories\"><label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"wp-block-categories-1\">Categories</label></div></aside></div></div></div></div><span class=\"select2 select2-container select2-container--default\" dir=\"ltr